    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This is a free plugin to sync the products generated by the embedded Sign Customiser app on your Woocommerce store to your cart.</p>\n<p>Managing your account and all data associated with Sign Customiser is done through the <a href=\"https://web.signcustomiser.com/login\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">web admin</a>.</p>\n<h3>Further information</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.signcustomiser.com/features/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Sign Customiser website</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.signcustomiser.com/features/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">View all features</a><br />\n<a href=\"https://www.signcustomiser.com/pricing/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Pricing</a></p>\n",
        "faq": "<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.signcustomiser.com/article/213-wordpress-integration-and-theme-setup\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Woocommerce integration guide</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.signcustomiser.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">General Docs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.signcustomiser.com/category/18-frequently-asked-questions\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.signcustomiser.com/contact/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Support</a></li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added support for syncing orders from Woocommerce to Sign Customiser.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial support for syncing products from an embedded customiser to Woocommerce cart.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Easily integrate add-to-cart functionality from your Sign Customiser account with WooCommerce.",
